cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Carbon Credit Provenance Ontology (CCPO)
message: If you use this ontology, please cite it as below.
type: dataset
abstract: >-
  A domain ontology for carbon credit provenance, extending the W3C PROV-O
  standard with the classes, properties and lifecycle constraints required to
  represent issuance, transfer and retirement across carbon registries.
keywords:
  - carbon credits
  - provenance
  - ontology
  - OWL 2
  - PROV-O
  - blockchain
license: CC-BY-4.0
